            {
                "comment": "This guy is straight up hilarious! He is probably the best lecturer i have had, even though others would say &quot;what the hell&#63;&quot; His class is hard, after all, it is ANALytical chemistry. He is very willing to help students out (he saved my groups ass on our project for the honors section), very great guy.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "This guy did not know how to teach. when i was taking him, about half of the class dropped off. he always confused why people did so bad in his exams. how could we do well when he tested on all the things that were not been emphasized in class&#63;&#63; He was presenting the material rather than teaching. Good luck on those who plan to take his class.",
